<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="ZoneTexte 3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{D3CC1D65-7B91-8F13-55B6-00170721F243}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="432485" y="160637"/><a:ext cx="5327099" cy="369332"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="none" rtlCol="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>4. La mise en valeur — Quand tout prend sens 💙</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-FR" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="5" name="ZoneTexte 4"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{5C92D63C-732D-6523-5C32-6CE3CF6B87DF}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="432485" y="529969"/><a:ext cx="10410222" cy="6740307"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="none" rtlCol="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Et puis vient ce moment magique où tout prend vie…</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Les meubles trouvent leur place, les matières se répondent, </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>les lumières révèlent les détails et soudain, ce n'est plus un chantier.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>C'est un chez-soi. Une histoire. Une émotion.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Cette maison m'a fait comprendre à quel point j'aimais imaginer, </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>transformer et surtout créer des lieux dans lesquels on se sent bien.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Alors, soutenue par ma famille, mes amis, mes collègues, ma directrice et surtout mon Amoureux, </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>j'ai osé changer de vie.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Je me suis lancée dans la décoration, d'abord à deux, avant de comprendre que, pour être </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>pleinement alignée avec moi-même, je devais poursuivre cette aventure seule.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Et c'est avec l'aide de mes enfants et de mon Amoureux qu'est née ma nouvelle identité :</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>CASA SENSO 💙</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Une maison, du sens, de l'émotion.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Aujourd'hui, les projets s'enchaînent : appartements, showroom, bar à vin… </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Et chaque nouvelle rencontre me confirme que j'ai fait le bon choix.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Car finalement, que ce soit devant une classe ou dans un intérieur à transformer, </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>mon moteur reste le même : </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>apporter du bonheur aux autres, voir leurs yeux briller.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Casa Senso, c'est cette envie de créer des intérieurs qui ont une âme, de proposer </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>un accompagnement clé en main, d'enlever la charge mentale pour ne laisser que le plaisir.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Et cette petite touche en plus qui fait toute la différence.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Aujourd'hui, je me lance seule, mais je ne me suis jamais sentie aussi entourée. ❤️Grazie Amore❤️</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Notre maison a été le début d'une incroyable aventure. Casa Senso en est la suite.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Et j'ai tellement hâte de la partager avec vous ! 💙</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-FR" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="437806125"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>